#!/usr/bin/env bash

set -euo pipefail

cat <<'INSTRUCTIONS'

Implement the request and commit.

Create 4 distinct prompts, each requesting:

- read-only adversarial review
- results to temp file

`h-review-4 'prompt 1' 'prompt 2' 'prompt 3' 'prompt 4'`

After reading reviews, delete temp files.

- If no changes necessary, rebase on `main`
- If rebase was no-op (no conflicts), run `notify-done-sound` and stop

If there were changes to be made or rebase failed, run `h-feedback <PROMPT ON WHAT TO DO>`
INSTRUCTIONS
